{"version":1,"key":"card:649","content":{"id":649,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想象你在一个滑梯的顶端，一旦你做了一个小小的让步或尝试（向前迈了一小步），由于重力作用，你会不由自主的沿着滑梯向下滑。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"滑梯效应就是你从一个小的让步开始："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"吃一口零食没事的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"今天少做一道题也没关系"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"截止日期还早，先打会儿游戏吧"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后引发了一系列的连锁反应："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上次吃一小口也没事，今天也吃一口吧，零食越吃越多，开始想减肥计划已经失败，破罐破摔"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"昨天少做一道，今天也少做点吧，作业越欠越多，反正补不完了，干脆不做了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"昨天玩了一天，今天也可以在玩一会儿，临近截止日期，大量任务没有完成，干脆不做了"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最终引向了一个重大的负面结果："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"减肥失败"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"期末考试挂科"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"项目没有完成，受到批评以及懊悔"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c2bb6932-e784-498f-994e-c7ff78bc0d9b.webp","uuid":"3c398393-5c20-445f-bbec-7fdb5812cada","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c2bb6932-e784-498f-994e-c7ff78bc0d9b.webp","width":701.0848473108825},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每一个单独的步骤看起来都很小、很合理，但把它们串联起来，就会把你带到一个你当初坚决反对的终点。"}]}],"tags":["心理学/滑梯效应","个人成长/习惯养成"],"createTime":1767056943727,"updateTime":1777355928203,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1777355928203}}